  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IGAD Strengthening M&amp;E Capacity The Horn of Africa Cross-Border Regions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this grant request is to: (i) improve the HIV/AIDS Monitoring and Evaluation (M&amp;E) capacity of participating countries comprising the Horn of Africa so that there is a comparable standard of quality across countries; (ii) establish a network of M&amp;E practitioners in the Horn of Africa dealing with HIV/AIDS to share experiences and contribute to sustainability; (iii) create a means to monitor trans-border prevalence levels, other health factors,  vehicle and people traffic, trade and other data   relevant to HIV/AIDS transmission; and iv) strengthen the institutional capacity and structure in the Horn of Africa, namely the .Inter-Governmental Authority for Development. (IGAD), to enable it to coordinate and harmonize efforts against HIV/AIDS.</narrative>
  </description>
